The native nvcompdx_ans.cu experiment adapts the block API structure of
ans_gpu_compression_decompression.cu and ans_gpu_decompression_reduction.cu
from NVIDIA MathDx 26.06.1's nvCOMPDx examples.

Copyright (c) 2025-2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. All rights reserved.
Those example portions are licensed under Apache-2.0; see nvcompdx_LICENSE.

Modifications: contiguous checkpoint-bank addressing; compacted compressed
streams; exact whole-bank reconstruction; a matched raw-to-shared checksum
control; resource queries; and an isolated C API for local experiments.

The nvCOMPDx SDK headers and device library are not included in this repository.
They remain in the ignored .research SDK directory and retain NVIDIA's license.
